OL,3,GNEWSALancashire 'never been nearer' to
OL,4,Ahaving a mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders in Lancashire say the county
OL,7,Fhas "never been nearer" to having a
OL,8,Fmayor, after the government confirmed
OL,9,Fit was one of 10 areas in the final
OL,10,Fstages of a new devolution agreement.
OL,12,FA devolution deal for Lancashire was
OL,13,Ffirst agreed in 2023, but it did not
OL,14,Finvolve a mayor at that time, with a
OL,15,Fcombined authority launched in 2025.
OL,17,FPhil Riley, the Labour leader of
OL,18,FBlackburn with Darwen Council, said the
OL,19,Fgovernment go-ahead was "a good thing",
OL,20,Fwhich would put Lancashire on a par
OL,21,Fwith Greater Manchester and the
OL,22,FLiverpool City Region.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
