OL,3,GNEWSALancashire 'never been nearer' to
OL,4,Ahaving a mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Atkinson, Reform leader of
OL,7,FLancashire County Council, also
OL,8,Fwelcomed the move but called for more
OL,9,Fdetails: "We need to see it in black
OL,10,Fand white," he said.
